                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00471/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00361/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一根黄瓜，似乎可以有效以令其恐惧的方法驱逐10米内的猫科动物。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██超市<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">储存在SITE-CN-81低价值物品柜中</span>用以防治SCP-CN-666-J与SCP-CN-667-J。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>猫难道真的怕黄瓜？——Dr.阙</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00361" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00361" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00361-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606074151" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597577708 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Aug 2020 11:35</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00278/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块型号不明的手机电池，当所处空间温度超过30℃时，该项目会迅速膨胀到汽车安全气囊的大小。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site23东侧的手机修理店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>保存于Site23的低风险异常项目仓库中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>“一名女士跟我说手机的安全气囊弹出来了，当时我还不信。”——潜伏于手机修理店的邢特工</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00278" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00278" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00278-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4136896&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606074151" alt="Ginger249-Jackie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4136896)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;">Ginger249-Jackie</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592710114 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">21 Jun 2020 03:28</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张铁架床，当有人躺在项目上并且闭上眼睛时，此人将持续听见“嗡嗡”声当对象睁眼时异常性质消失<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的卧室中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于低价值异常物品收容室<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>哪里有蚊子啊啊啊啊！搞得我一宿没睡觉啊啊啊啊！</em>——在卧室中喷了一整瓶花露水的Dr.pigeon</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00224" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00224-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606074151" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590860663 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 May 2020 17:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00452/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;图片文件</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">V&nbsp;文件名错误</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://i.postimg.cc/m2QkMpSk/zin.png" alt="zin.png" class="image" /></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00452" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00452" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00452-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tomato-potato-mix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4075168); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4075168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606074152" alt="TOMATO-POTATO-MIX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4075168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tomato-potato-mix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4075168); return false;">TOMATO-POTATO-MIX</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1603889376 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Oct 2020 12:49</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00434/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把四位转轮密码挂锁，当使用者设定密码后，密码将在[数据删除]天后失效，穷举法证明此时该锁不存在正确的密码。商标显示该锁为“OldC锁具&amp;劣质产品®联名款”<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员ENC的寝室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被研究员ENC以[数据删除]牛顿的力量强行扭开而损坏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>淦！老子的零食，医药包和[数据删除]都锁在里面呢！——研究员ENC</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;研究员ENC收到的来信，推测为OldC锁具公司发送</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点击隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>很抱歉给您带来了不好的用户体验</strong><br />
我们的本意是制造一款定期更换密码的门锁，结果他们搞砸了</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00434" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00434" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00434-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606074152" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602069146 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 11:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00107/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一款无任何商品标识的餐盒，任何被放入其中的食物都会转化为通过相同烹饪方式的不同食物。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82员工食堂。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-82中价值物品仓库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我倒进去了半杯早上没喝完的豆浆，结果它给我出来了一杯咖啡。。。而且我拿去检测了一下除了卡布奇诺以外什么都有。。。</em>-不喜欢喝咖啡而且只喝卡布奇诺的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>嗯。。。我差点因为这玩意被开除。。。原因是在站点里面吃<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wontoninsurgency">馄饨</a>！</em>-Dr.Tian<br />
<em>我的大闸蟹啊！我[数据删除]这[数据删除]的大饼！</em>-特工赵</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00107" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00107" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
